--- Return the retained handle transferred by a write2 request, or nil for a request without one.
-- @return Copied or retained handle_t result, or nil on failure or absence.
-- @usage uv/supplemental.md#write_tsend_handle
function write_t:send_handle(): handle_t?
  return self.send_stream
end
